DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T140000
LOCATION:Shone Farm
SUMMARY:Summer U-Pick at Shone Farm
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fantastic afternoon on the farm. U-pick flowers
 \, fruits and vegetables while exploring the grounds and shopping at our 
 farm stand.  We will also be selling cut flowers\, vegetables\, fruit\, b
 eef\, and value-added goods including olive oil and berry preserves.What 
 to bring:  Bring your own basket/container to help us reduce waste! If yo
 u bring wicker\, metal\, or thick plastic\, stop by the cashier before yo
 u head out to the field.  We recommend wearing sunscreen\, a hat\, and co
 mfortable shoes and bringing a water bottle.Event detailsFree admittance 
 &amp\; open to the public  Kid &amp\; family friendly  Card and tap-to-pa
 y accepted  Free parking and admission  No reservation needed  Meet our s
 tudents and see them in action!  No dogs permitted\, except assistance do
 gs  For more information\, click here to visit Shone Farm's U-Pick page. 
 (https://shonefarm.santarosa.edu/summer-u-pick)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join us for a fantastic afternoon on th
 e farm. U-pick flowers\, fruits and vegetables while exploring the ground
 s and shopping at our farm stand.</p><p>  We will also be selling cut flo
 wers\, vegetables\, fruit\, beef\, and value-added goods including olive 
 oil and berry preserves.</p><p><strong>What to bring:</strong><br />  Bri
 ng your own basket/container to help us reduce waste! If you bring wicker
 \, metal\, or thick plastic\, stop by the cashier before you head out to 
 the field.</p><p>  We recommend wearing sunscreen\, a hat\, and comfortab
 le shoes and bringing a water bottle.</p><p><strong>Event details</strong
 ></p><ul><li>Free admittance &amp\; open to the public  </li><li>Kid &amp
 \; family friendly  </li><li>Card and tap-to-pay accepted  </li><li>Free 
 parking and admission  </li><li>No reservation needed  </li><li>Meet our 
 students and see them in action!  </li><li>No dogs permitted\, except ass
 istance dogs  </li></ul><p><a href="https://shonefarm.santarosa.edu/summe
 r-u-pick" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information\, click her
 e to visit Shone Farm's U-Pick page.</a></p>
